# OIA 5302 Demo — Project Rules

## Context

- RFQ 5302 AI Recruitment Assistant vertical slice (S0–S8)
- Dual portals: Candidate (Jadarah) / HR (OIA SSO)
- Synthetic data only; no real PII
- Live demo: https://oia-rfq-5302.surge.sh

## Code conventions

- Minimize diff scope; match existing React + Vite patterns
- Bilingual EN/AR where the step requires it
- Mock AI is intentional; label interfaces ready for GPU models later

## Deploy & demo

```bash
npm run demo:offline      # local issue demo (127.0.0.1:4173)
npm run deploy:surge      # online preview
npm run demo:documents:publish  # regenerate controlled PDFs/HTML
```

## Surge PDF limitation

Surge free tier blocks PDF hosting. Use HTML views via `controlledViewUrl()` and in-app `SourceDocumentModal`.

## Session UX

- Landing page on reload: do not persist `role` in sessionStorage
- Source document links: in-app modal, not new-tab full page

## Daily workflow

End of day: user asks for daily log → update `docs/daily-logs/YYYY-MM-DD.md` → commit & push for 3-machine sync.

## Paused work

- 3D Avatar (VRoid / MakeHuman) until `.vrm` at `public/avatar/oia-vroid-interviewer.vrm`
- Video synthesis not priority for issue delivery
